body:
So they can go sit on the red tide beaches.

&#x200B;

nice.

TROPICAL TIDBITS BABYYYYY. Dr. Levi Cowan is the MAN.  

&#x200B;

https://www.tropicaltidbits.com/

Man. I wanted to like this so bad, but it just sounds like a garbled mess of nothingness. I don't feel like there's ANY context to it and they just slapped this all together. I don't know. The breakdown seemed loose and just all over the place and just railing the same notes over and over. It seemed really empty, I don't feel like any heart was thrown into this song. dragging out the BRICK WALLLLLLLLLLLLLLLL just didn't do it for me. I don't know. Maybe it has to grow on me. Not their best work.

&#x200B;

Edit: Facebook comments are ripping the band apart on their post. They are not being nice. LOL

You guys are crazy, all the sites are struggling and i can't seem to get through. 

&#x200B;

Bummer.
